{"availability":"available","full":"garyhtou/vanta","name":"vanta","description":"Scroll-driven 3D landing site for the VANTA Prospector, a fictional autonomous planetary rover. React Three Fiber plus a procedurally-sculpted Blender rover, with a driveable mini-game. Built with Claude Code and the high-fidelity-web plugin.","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":4,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-21T04:35:16Z","updated":"2026-07-19T02:31:58Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://vanta.garytou.dev","topics":["3d","awwwards","blender","claude-code","demo","design-engineering","gltf","interactive","landing-page","motion-design","react-three-fiber","scroll-animation","scrollytelling","threejs","vite","webgl"],"demo":"https://vanta.garytou.dev/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T11:09:38.736Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T11:09:38.736Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T11:09:38.736Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T11:09:38.736Z","stars":4,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Three.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The explorers that go first. Autonomous rovers that survey new worlds before we ever set foot on them, and stream them home in real time: the spirit of JPL's great science rovers, built at the pace of a modern hardware company.","Extend human reach without human risk. Every ridge, lava tube, and crater floor that was \"too far, too cold, too dark\" becomes surveyable. The bottleneck was never mobility, it's trust: scientists and operators need to feel the terrain before they commit a lander or a crew. So the product is as much the telemetry experience as the hardware, and this site sells that the same way: you don't read a spec sheet, you take the wheel."],"features":["Autonomous path planning across unmapped terrain (the site's drive mode is","the manual override of this).","Deployable sensor mast: LIDAR + stereo hazard cameras, raises on arrival.","Foldable solar array: gallium-arsenide wings that track the sun.